msgctxt "Asm4|"
msgid ""
"Calculates element placements in relation to the Axis.\n"
"Each element is assigned an Index starting from 0\n"
"The Index can be used in expressions calculating this Placement or its "
"sub-properties\n"
"Expression examples:\n"
"on Angle: Index%2==0?30:-30\n"
"on Position.X: Index*30"
msgstr ""
"計算相對於軸的元素放置.\n"
"每個元素分配一個從0開始的索引(Index)\n"
"索引可用於計算此 '放置位置' 或其子屬性的表達式中\n"
"表達範例:\n"
"角度: Index%2==0?30:-30\n"
"在位置.X: Index*30"

