msgctxt "Fasteners|"
msgid ""
"<p>Insert a Washer into the Assembly</p><p>If another fastener is selected, "
"a new fastener of the same type is created in the same assembly.If an axis "
"or LCS is selected, the new fastener will be attached to it.If an assembly "
"is selected, the new fastener will be inside that assembly.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>將墊圈插入零件組合</p><p>如果選擇了另一個緊固件，則會在同一零件組合中建立相同類型的新緊固件。如果選擇了軸或LCS，如果選擇了某個零件組合則會附加新緊固件，新的緊固件將位於該零件組合內.</p>"

